  'dom.create-text-node': 'Creates a text node'
  'dom.decode-entities': `
Decodes the entities in s[from..to) (named entities are looked up in DOM-ENTITY-BLOB,
numeric ones are &#NN; or &#xHH;)
html=true: unknown or unterminated entities are kept verbatim; html=false: an unknown entity
is an error
Returns out = the decoded result, ok = whether it succeeded (in XML mode an illegal entity
gives ok=false)
`
  'dom.document-element': 'The root element (the first ELEMENT child)'
  'dom.dom-closers-of': `
The word table of open tags that must be closed first when tag t is opened (empty string =
no rule)
