  'yaml.yaml-nan': `
Runtime division is required: compile-time constant folding evaluates `0.0 / 0.0` as 0.
Going through a local variable avoids folding and yields a real NaN (`x != x` is true).
`
  'yaml.yaml-node-is-nan': `
The fval of `.nan` is filled with a real NaN by yaml-nan(), so it is detected by value
(NaN != NaN). Checking the node's raw text is the fallback: paths such as tag rewriting may
change text without recomputing fval.
`
