Skips leading spaces before counting: nearly every call site follows skip-blank-lines(), at
which point pos sits at the start of a line (column 0). Subtracting directly would always
yield 0 and nested blocks would be judged not indented. After skipping, pos sits on the first
non-space character, which the following is-seq-dash / looks-like-map-entry / at-doc-marker
checks also need.
`
